# Project requirements installed ON TOP of the vLLM base image (SPEC §4.4).
# vllm, torch, transformers, openai, pydantic (v2) come from the base image and
# must not be re-pinned here: re-installing them would replace the Blackwell
# builds shipped in the image. Keep this file in sync with pyproject.toml
# `dependencies`; tools/gen_requirements_lock.sh checks the overlap.
